/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 41 614 [
[(Some control operations can be carried out entirely by tilde)]
[(objects passing audio signals around. Here is an imitation of)]
[(an analog sequencer and envelope generator. A [phasor~] is)]
[(multiplying by 9 to loop through the sequence table \050"$0-seq"\051)]
[(at 0.6 Hz, generating 9 frequencies. Simultaneously, by)]
[(wrapping the same signal that reads the first table, we)]
[(multiply the [phasor~] frequency by 9 \0509 * 0.6 = 5.4 Hz\051 and)]
[(read a second table for an envelope shape. This becomes the)]
[(grain size for a sampler based on the B08.sampler.loop example)]
[(earlier.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 178 252 [
